                                                "sense_id": "72fe01f8-4064-3e31-85ba-54eb0d78dc07",
                                                "text": "Harry Meadows ... was in his late forties, ate too much, chain-smoked cheap cigars, drank bonded Bourbon, and was, in the words of his doctor, the Western world's leading candidate for a huge coronary infarction."
                                            }
